boat.com/blog/2026/10/finally-rose-tinted-solar-panels-could-let-crops-and-electricity-share-the-same-land</guid></item><item><title>科学家刚刚发现了一种令人惊讶的痴呆症新风险因素——它与遗传学无关</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-just-discovered-a-surprising-new-risk-factor-for-dementia-and-it-has-nothing-to-do-with-genetics</link><description>另外，研究结果对您意味着什么。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-just-discovered-a-surprising-new-risk-factor-for-dementia-and-it-has-nothing-to-do-with-genetics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 01:55:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/scientists-just-discovered-a-surprising-new-risk-factor-for-dementia-and-it-has-nothing-to-do-with-genetics</guid></item><item><title>物理学家发现了一种“打破”时间对称性的超导体——这在同类中尚属首次</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-find-a-superconductor-that-breaks-the-symmetry-of-time-a-first-for-its-kind</link><description>在某些条件下——例如比深空温度低的骨脆化温度——超导体可以&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/physicists-find-a-superconductor-that-breaks-the-symmetry-of-time-a-first-for-its-kind.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 01:40:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-find-a-superconductor-that-breaks-the-symmetry-of-time-a-first-for-its-kind</guid></item><item><title>物理学家推出了有史以来最精确的原子钟——它实际上可以重新定义秒</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-unveil-the-most-accurate-atomic-clock-ever-and-it-could-literally-redefine-the-second</link><description>物理学家使用放射性镥创造了他们所说的有史以来最精确的原子钟，可以完美地将时间精确到小数点后 19 位。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/physicists-unveil-the-most-accurate-atomic-clock-ever-and-it-could-literally-redefine-the-second.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 01:25:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-unveil-the-most-accurate-atomic-clock-ever-and-it-could-literally-redefine-the-second</guid></item><item><title>细胞保存技术可以使 CAR-T 细胞治疗更容易实现</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/cell-preservation-technique-could-make-car-t-cell-therapy-more-accessible</link><description>被设计用来攻击癌细胞的免疫细胞（称为 CAR-T 细胞）用于治疗某些类型的血癌。然而，美国只有约 5% 的医院有能力生成并向患者提供 CAR-T 细胞。对于许多患者来说，这意味着细胞需要冷冻并长途运输。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cell-preservation-technique-could-make-car-t-cell-therapy-more-accessible2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 01:10:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/cell-preservation-technique-could-make-car-t-cell-therapy-more-accessible</guid></item><item><title>脑室内 Magna 载体递送后 AAV 整合的神经上皮肿瘤</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/neuroepithelial-tumor-with-aav-integration-after-intracisternal-magna-vector-delivery</link><description>一名男孩在 AAV 基因治疗粘多糖贮积症 (MPS) 后患上脑肿瘤的临床报告。幸运的是，尽管患有 MPS、癌症并接受了肿瘤切除手术，但到目前为止，这名男孩仍然存活下来并茁壮成长。对肿瘤的分子分析表明，该肿瘤是由 AAV 的部分 DNA 整合到基因组中引起的，从而引发了一种名为 PLAG1 的癌基因的过度表达。该病例凸显了 AAV 基因治疗中罕见整合事件的临床重要性，并提醒我们必须对这些治疗的风险保持警惕。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/neuroepithelial-tumor-with-aav-integration-after-intracisternal-magna-vector-delivery2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 00:55:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/neuroepithelial-tumor-with-aav-integration-after-intracisternal-magna-vector-delivery</guid></item><item><title>移至 STEM。人工智能学位有望卷土重来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/move-over-stem-humanities-degrees-are-poised-for-a-comeback-thanks-to-ai</link><description>自2012年以来，随着学生们追求看似有保证的职业回报的学位，人文学科专业的数量急剧下降。但就业市场已经发生了变化。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/move-over-stem-humanities-degrees-are-poised-for-a-comeback-thanks-to-ai.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 00:40:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/move-over-stem-humanities-degrees-are-poised-for-a-comeback-thanks-to-ai</guid></item><item><title>线粒体载体SLC25A34将脂肪细胞脂质循环的时钟、饮食和温度控制联系起来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/mitochondrial-carrier-slc25a34-links-clock-diet-and-temperature-control-of-adipocyte-lipid-cycling</link><description>一个意想不到的、潜在的重大发现： &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mitochondrial-carrier-slc25a34-links-clock-diet-and-temperature-control-of-adipocyte-lipid-cycling2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 00:25:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/mitochondrial-carrier-slc25a34-links-clock-diet-and-temperature-control-of-adipocyte-lipid-cycling</guid></item></channel></rss>